BBUUGGSS
     The OneRNG permits downloading of the device firmware so that one may
     check the firmware's cryptographic signature as provided by the manufac‐
     turer.  The uuoonneerrnngg driver does not perform nor support this action.  In
     order to currently perform such a validation, it would be necessary to
     disable uuoonneerrnngg in the kernel and then download the firmware via the On‐
     eRNG's emulated AT modem command set.

